#. module: qs_iframe
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_qs_iframe
msgid ""
"\n"
"Adds a configurable iframe action to the Odoo backend. Administrators maintain a\n"
"list of named URLs (qs.iframe.list); users pick one from a dropdown and the page\n"
"is rendered inline, with refresh and open-in-new-window controls.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"为 Odoo 后台添加了一个可配置的 iframe 操作。管理员维护一个命名 URL 列；用户从下拉菜单中选择一个链接，页面将以内联方式显示，并提供刷新和在新窗口中打开的控制选项。\n"

